---
description: Never attribute commits or changes to Cursor
alwaysApply: true
---

# Commits without Cursor attribution

When creating git commits or describing the change:

- Do not add `Co-authored-by: Cursor` or any Cursor email
- Do not write "Made with Cursor", "Generated by Cursor", "Cursor agent", or similar in the subject, body, or trailers
- Do not mention Cursor as the author of the work
- Author stays the repository user only
- If a hook or wrapper appends a Cursor trailer, remove it before pushing
